      "description": "Hero query selector with an explicit selected state.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chip-row\"><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Google</button><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Maps</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chip-row{display:flex;gap:.35rem}.ds-chip{min-height:2.75rem;padding:0 .72rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border-subtle,#e2e8f0);border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.76);font:700 .5rem var(--font-sans,Manrope,Arial,sans-serif);color:var(--color-text-muted,#64748b);cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .2s}.ds-chip[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--color-action-primary,#2f6bff);border-color:var(--color-action-primary,#2f6bff);color:#fff}.ds-chip:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);border-color:var(--blue-200,#c9d9ff)}.ds-chip:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-focus,#9fbcff) 38%,transparent)}"
