    {
      "name": "Pricing Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "description": "Sans title, subordinate tier label, and large tabular price.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-price-card\"><span>01 / PUESTA A PUNTO</span><h3>Ajustar lo que ya tienes.</h3><p>Cuando no necesitas rehacer todo: necesitas mejorar una prioridad concreta.</p><small>desde</small><strong>$89.000</strong><small>CLP</small></article>",
      "css": ".ds-price-card{max-width:23rem;padding:2rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border-subtle,#e2e8f0);border-radius:1.6rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);color:var(--color-text-primary,#08111f);font-family:var(--font-sans,Manrope,Arial,sans-serif);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm,0 6px 18px rgba(15,23,42,.06));transition:transform .28s var(--ease-emphasized,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)),box-shadow .28s}.ds-price-card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg,0 28px 80px rgba(15,23,42,.14))}.ds-price-card>span{display:block;margin-bottom:1.25rem;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--coral-700,#b62438)}.ds-price-card h3{font-size:1.9rem;line-height:1.18;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:750}.ds-price-card p{font-size:1rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--color-text-secondary,#334155)}.ds-price-card small{display:block;font-size:.8125rem;color:var(--color-text-muted,#64748b)}.ds-price-card strong{display:block;font-size:3.5rem;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.055em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-price-card{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Diagnosis Panel",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "diagnosis-panel",
      "description": "Flat response panel paired with the three problem selectors.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-diagnosis\"><span>CÓMO TE AYUDAMOS</span><h3>SEO local y Google Maps</h3><p>Ordenamos tu perfil y tus páginas para que expliquen qué haces y dónde atiendes.</p><div>✓ Perfil de Google optimizado</div><a href=\"#diagnostico\">Consultar este servicio →</a></div>",
      "css": ".ds-diagnosis{max-width:34rem;padding:2rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border-subtle,#e2e8f0);border-radius:1.25rem;background:#f7f9fc;color:var(--color-text-primary,#08111f);font-family:var(--font-sans,Manrope,Arial,sans-serif)}.ds-diagnosis>span{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--color-text-muted,#64748b)}.ds-diagnosis h3{font-size:2.5rem;line-height:1.16;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:750;margin:1.5rem 0 1rem}.ds-diagnosis p{font-size:1rem;line-height:1.6}.ds-diagnosis>div{padding:.6rem 0;font-size:.9375rem;font-weight:650}.ds-diagnosis a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;margin-top:1rem;font-size:.9375rem;font-weight:750;color:var(--color-action-primary-hover,#2454d8);text-decoration:none}.ds-diagnosis a:hover{text-decoration:underline}.ds-diagnosis a:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-focus,#9fbcff) 38%,transparent)}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** use bright Signal Coral for small text on light surfaces; use Readable Coral.",
      "**Don't** add serif styling to every heading or UI label.",
      "**Don't** add redundant eyebrows to sections whose titles already provide context.",
      "**Don't** present illustrative diagrams or interface examples as measured client results."
    ],
    "northStar": "Clear Digital Signals",
    "overview": "This name describes the implemented public site's signal motif and clear hierarchy. Action Blue controls, dark navy sections, white reading surfaces, and spacious rows make the next step visible. Rounded demonstrations illustrate the services alongside direct, readable copy.\n\nThis record covers the static site in `site/`, including its home and editorial styles. It does not specify the separate Next application. It is a scan of the built interface, not a product specification; no PRODUCT.md exists. The source tokens are in `site/styles/tokens.css`; component and page overrides remain authoritative for exact selectors. Homepage CSS is assembled into `site/home-core.css`.",
    "dos": [
      "**Do** use semantic CSS tokens for color, spacing, radius, and interaction states.",
      "**Do** use Manrope for clear headings, interface text, and price numerals.",
      "**Do** preserve visible focus, active states, and reduced motion behavior.",
      "**Do** keep illustrative examples labeled and their text readable at mobile widths."
    ],
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Bold Manrope hierarchy with an italic Instrument Serif hero accent.",
      "Blue actions, navy section backgrounds, and restrained coral markers.",
      "Spacious sections, readable content rows, and rounded illustrative surfaces.",
      "Visible hover, focus, selection, and disclosure states."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Readable Accent Rule",
        "body": "Use Readable Coral for small coral text on light surfaces; bright Signal Coral remains a decorative accent.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Shared Sans Rule",
        "body": "Use Manrope for interface labels, section headings, article headings, and prices. Preserve the implemented serif accent and quotation treatments without spreading them into additional UI roles.",
        "section": "typography"
      }
    ]
  }
}